138	/* ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
139	 * Tiny, self-contained markdown → HTML renderer.
140	 *
141	 * No external dependency. Handles: # / ## / ### headings, **bold**, `code`,
142	 * fenced ``` code blocks, - / * and 1. lists, [links](url), and blank-line
143	 * separated paragraphs. HTML is escaped BEFORE any markdown is applied, and
144	 * inline code spans are protected so their contents are never re-processed.
145	 * Output carries Tailwind classes so it reads well on the dark theme (there is
146	 * no typography plugin installed).
147	 * ------------------------------------------------------------------------- */
